WWE 2K15 Android: the texture fetch constant "invalid type" warning is logged 20 times, then once in 10000 (it came hundreds of times a second in matches, on the GPU command thread).

diff --git a/src/graphics/pipeline/texture/cache.cpp b/src/graphics/pipeline/texture/cache.cpp
index 0709fc3..630b968 100644
--- a/src/graphics/pipeline/texture/cache.cpp
+++ b/src/graphics/pipeline/texture/cache.cpp
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
